Third-party components

agentsurface builds against the Go standard library only. It has no
third-party Go module dependencies, which the no-network check in CI enforces
(see .github/workflows/no-network.yml). If a third-party dependency is ever
added, its copyright and licence notice is recorded in this file at the same
time.

